    "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Reject SHERIFF self-judgment in the verdict contract**\n\nA document with both `agentId: \"SHERIFF\"` and `sheriffId: \"SHERIFF\"` currently satisfies this schema, so the durable contract accepts exactly the self-judgment the policy prohibits. Because these verdicts drive holds and scores, add a structured issuer identity and a cross-field/validator constraint that proves the issuer is independent of the affected agent.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L45-L45](https://github.com/Lester-Sparx/zorr-blatt-shared-hq/blob/f7f7c2f1c3227004c6834c31650564e2c3d4bee8/AGENTS.md#L45-L45)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
    "commit_id": "f7f7c2f1c3227004c6834c31650564e2c3d4bee8",
    "created_at": "2026-08-29T08:32:18Z",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -0,0 +1,145 @@\n+{\n+  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n+  \"$id\": \"https://github.com/Lester-Sparx/zorr-blatt-shared-hq/schemas/SHERIFF_VERDICT_V1.schema.json\",\n+  \"title\": \"ZORR BLATT SHERIFF Verdict V1\",\n+  \"type\": \"object\",\n+  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n+  \"required\": [\n+    \"schemaVersion\",\n+    \"verdictId\",\n+    \"agentId\",\n+    \"logicalRole\",\n+    \"taskRef\",\n+    \"incidentClass\",\n+    \"evidence\",\n+    \"errorSignature\",\n+    \"rootCause\",\n+    \"selfCaught\",\n+    \"repeatOf\",\n+    \"decision\",\n+    \"remediation\",\n+    \"regressionTest\",\n+    \"lessonRef\",\n+    \"status\",\n+    \"sheriffId\",\n+    \"issuedAt\"\n+  ],\n+  \"properties\": {\n+    \"schemaVersion\": {\n+      \"const\": \"SHERIFF_VERDICT_V1\"\n+    },\n+    \"verdictId\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"pattern\": \"^SV1-[A-Z0-9][A-Z0-9._-]{2,127}$\"\n+    },\n+    \"agentId\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"enum\": [\"LESTER\", \"DUNCAN\", \"DJANGO\", \"JINGO\", \"SHERIFF\"]\n+    },\n+    \"logicalRole\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"minLength\": 1,\n+      \"maxLength\": 64\n+    },\n+    \"taskRef\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"minLength\": 1,\n+      \"maxLength\": 512\n+    },\n+    \"incidentClass\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"enum\": [\n+        \"I0_SELF_CAUGHT\",\n+        \"I1_CORRECTNESS\",\n+        \"I2_PROCESS\",\n+        \"I3_CRITICAL_INTEGRITY\",\n+        \"I4_SAFETY_SECURITY\"\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    \"evidence\": {\n+      \"type\": \"array\",\n+      \"minItems\": 1,\n+      \"uniqueItems\": true,\n+      \"items\": {\n+        \"type\": \"string\",\n+        \"minLength\": 1,\n+        \"maxLength\": 1024\n+      }\n+    },\n+    \"errorSignature\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"minLength\": 1,\n+      \"maxLength\": 256\n+    },\n+    \"rootCause\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"minLength\": 1,\n+      \"maxLength\": 4000\n+    },\n+    \"selfCaught\": {\n+      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n+    },\n+    \"repeatOf\": {\n+      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n+      \"maxLength\": 128\n+    },\n+    \"decision\": {\n+      \"type\": \"object\",\n+      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n+      \"required\": [\"disciplineDelta\", \"meritDelta\", \"executionGate\", \"ownerActionRequired\", \"reason\"],\n+      \"properties\": {\n+        \"disciplineDelta\": {\n+          \"type\": \"integer\",\n+          \"minimum\": -40,\n+          \"maximum\": 0\n+        },\n+        \"meritDelta\": {\n+          \"type\": \"integer\",\n+          \"minimum\": 0,\n+          \"maximum\": 25\n+        },\n+        \"executionGate\": {\n+          \"type\": \"string\",\n+          \"enum\": [\"NONE\", \"HOLD\", \"HARD_HOLD\"]\n+        },\n+        \"ownerActionRequired\": {\n+          \"type\": \"boolean\"\n+        },\n+        \"reason\": {\n+          \"type\": \"string\",\n+          \"minLength\": 1,\n+          \"maxLength\": 4000\n+        }\n+      }\n+    },\n+    \"remediation\": {\n+      \"type\": \"array\",\n+      \"items\": {\n+        \"type\": \"string\",\n+        \"minLength\": 1,\n+        \"maxLength\": 1024\n+      }\n+    },\n+    \"regressionTest\": {\n+      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n+      \"maxLength\": 1024\n+    },\n+    \"lessonRef\": {\n+      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n+      \"maxLength\": 1024\n+    },\n+    \"status\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"enum\": [\"OPEN\", \"REMEDIATED\", \"CLOSED\"]\n+    },\n+    \"sheriffId\": {\n+      \"type\": \"string\",\n+      \"minLength\": 1,\n+      \"maxLength\": 128",
